From ea085cdf160779ee95c34eb4b31c2a922a99181f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:31:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v2.5.1: pre-public MED/HIGH remediation, code-review fixes,
 and UI refinements

Firewall engine (reaper_fw.c): zone-constraint drop-with-log; port-forward
range colon->hyphen; atomic apply.sh generation via temp+rename; NAT-rule
drop-logging; build-failure reporting.

Warden (rwarden.c): OK-gated lastupd stamp so a partial feed update no longer
advances the timestamp; retention-block reorder; per-run flock.

httpd (web.c): firewall 3-state active reporting; per-record length cap before
nvram_set; store-resolver USB device-boundary guards; Gatekeeper status now/path
emission; mesh-node RE fallback classification.

Store resolver (rwatch.c, services.c): mount-boundary guards; MCP stale-session
sweep split into boot vs runtime.

QoS (qos.c, Reaper_QoS.asp): classful egress headroom; decimal-kbps unit
correction; stats timer gating.

Inherited: OpenVPN if-field newline (openvpn_setup.c); SNMP rwuser policy;
esc() consolidation across the GK/Warden/Firewall pages.

UI: dashboard logo header alignment; firmware Mesh-Nodes section ordering;
analytics/traffic/wireless/GK/firmware page touch-ups.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
